OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSunny spells and largely dry
OL,6,Fconditions for most. A few showers
OL,7,Fmainly in the west, with blustery
OL,8,Fwinds in the northwest. Cloud and
OL,9,Fshowery rain reach Northern Ireland
OL,10,Flater. Cooler than Wednesday, with
OL,11,Ftemperatures closer to average.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FDry with clear spells in the
OL,14,Fsouth and southeast, chilly in rural
OL,15,Fareas with isolated mist or fog. Windy
OL,16,Felsewhere with showers, some heavy and
OL,17,Fpersistent, especially across
OL,18,Fsouthwest Scotland.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
