OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FBands of heavy showers, with a
OL,6,Frisk of hail and thunder, move
OL,7,Fnortheast across many areas. Further
OL,8,Fshowers follow in the northwest, while
OL,9,Fsoutheast England stays largely dry
OL,10,Fand warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
